d-Publications/Whats-New?sc_lang=en)\n- [Listing Newsletters](/Listing/News-and-Publications/Newsletters/All-newsletters?sc_lang=en)\n- [Reports](/Listing/News-and-Publications/Reports?sc_lang=en)\n- [Listing Consultations](/Listing/News-and-Publications/Listing-Consultations?sc_lang=en)\n\n- /Listing/Sustainability/ESG-Academy?sc_lang=en[Sustainability & Governance](/Listing/Sustainability/ESG-Academy?sc_lang=en)A centralised platform to advance issuers’ ESG journey and corporate governance.\n- /Listing/Education-Centre?sc_lang=en[Education Centre](/Listing/Education-Centre?sc_lang=en)A centralised education platform, including e-Learning.\n- /Listing/About-Listing-and-Contacts/About-Listing-and-Contacts?sc_lang=en[About Listing & Contacts](/Listing/About-Listing-and-Contacts/About-Listing-and-Contacts?sc_lang=en)Find information about listing, including committee members and contact persons.\n\n- [Newscentre](/News/News-Centre?sc_lang=en)[Corporate News Releases](/News/News-Release?sc_lang=en)\n\n- [Regulatory Announcements](/News/Regulatory-Announcements?sc_lang=en)\n\n- [Market Communications](/News/Market-Communications?sc_lang=en)\n\n- [Market Consultations](/News/Market-Consultations?sc_lang=en)\n\n- /News/News-Centre?sc_lang=en[News Centre](/News/News-Centre?sc_lang=en)Snapshot about HKEX latest news and information\n- /News/HKEX-Calendar?sc_lang=en[HKEX Calendar](/News/HKEX-Calendar?sc_lang=en)Subscribe to our calendar containing trading and clearing information, public holidays and more\n- /News/Research-Reports?sc_lang=en[Research Reports](/News/Research-Reports?sc_lang=en)Research and survey conducted by HKEX on its securities and derivatives markets and related topics\n\n- [ConnectProgrammes](#)[Connect Hub](/Mutual-Market/Connect-Hub?sc_lang=en)\n- [Stock Connect](/Mutual-Market/Stock-Connect?sc_lang=en)\n- [Bond Connect](http://www.chinabondconnect.com)\n- [Swap Connect](/Mutual-Market/Swap-Connect/Swap-Connect?sc_lang=en)\n\n- /Mutual-Market/Stock-Co